  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "v.",
      "zh": "允许，准许"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Hurry up! Once the concert starts, nobody is "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "allowed"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " to enter the concert hall."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "快点！一旦音乐会开始，就不允许任何人进入音乐厅了。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "allow 是常考单词，相当于 let sb. do sth.，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：aren’t allowed to do 与 mustn’t do 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Students "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "aren’t allowed to smoke"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " because smoking is harmful to their health."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Students "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "mustn’t smoke"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " because smoking is harmful to their health."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "学生不允许吸烟是因为吸烟有害健康。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
